  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jääk nhial kɛnɛ ko̱l gɔ̱rä mi tɔt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jääk nhial dɔ̱diɛn mi bum nɛn, bëë piny nhial, ca kum kɛ pua̱r, kä te tik Kuɔth nhial wi̱i̱dɛ. Kä ce̱t nhiamdɛ kɛ cäŋ kä ce̱t ciökɛ kɛ bo̱l maac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te tetdɛ kɛ ko̱l gɔ̱rä mi tɔt mi ca lɛp. Kä cɛ cio̱o̱k cuëëcdɛ la̱th bar, kä te cio̱o̱k caamdɛ raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ciöt kɛ jɔw mi diit, mi ce̱tkɛ bur luɔny. Kä mëë cɛ ciöt, cu ma̱a̱r da̱ŋ bärɔw ma̱a̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ma̱a̱r da̱ŋ bärɔw ma̱r, cua jɛ dee gɔ̱r, kä duundɛ ɣöö cua jɔw liŋ nhial wëë i̱, “Dil min ca la̱r ji̱ ɛ ma̱a̱r da̱ŋ bärɔw, kä /cu jɛ gɔ̱r piny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk nhial in cä nɛn cuŋä bar kɛnɛ rar,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jɔw ëë cä liŋ nhial lɛni ruac kɛ ɣä, wëë i̱, “Wër, käni ko̱l gɔ̱rä in ca lɛp tetdä jäkä nhial in te cuŋä bar kɛnɛ rar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cua wä kä jääk nhial, cua jɛ jiök kɛ ɣöö bɛ ɣä ka̱m ko̱l gɔ̱rä in tɔt. Kä cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Käni jɛ kä cam ɛ, bɛ kɛ̈c jiidu, kä bɛ liɛm thokdu ce̱tkɛ tuaar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua ko̱l gɔ̱rä in tɔt ka̱n tetdä jäkä nhial, kä cua jɛ cam, limɛ thokdä ce̱tkɛ tuaar, kä mëë cä jɛ cam, cuɛ jicdä jakä kɛc ɛ ɣɔr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Bi ruac Kuɔth dhil nyɔk kɛ lat kɛ kui̱ nath, kɛ döör, kɛnɛ thuk ti gööl, kɛ kua̱r.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
